se menciona en la conversación de los asistentes al funeral."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"holland","collection":"cited","name":"Holland","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"586ababa36676f53b8e33c7210551823e786d8e277f3e278b99ceaef8c63d4b6","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Holland is listed among the shipping destinations linked to Dublin’s transit sheds.","it":"L’Olanda è elencata fra le destinazioni marittime collegate ai magazzini di transito di Dublino.","fr":"La Hollande figure parmi les destinations maritimes liées aux entrepôts de transit de Dublin.","es":"Holanda figura entre los destinos marítimos vinculados a los almacenes de tránsito de Dublín."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"hungary","collection":"cited","name":"Hungary","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"0f6e629d35f88d89d54c14518ab9e100e495bd9f48cc34661bd90222d76cacfd","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Hungary appears in Rudolph Virag’s notice of his change of name to Bloom.","it":"L’Ungheria compare nell’avviso con cui Rudolph Virag annuncia il cambio del nome in Bloom.","fr":"La Hongrie apparaît dans l’avis par lequel Rudolph Virag annonce son changement de nom en Bloom.","es":"Hungría aparece en el aviso por el que Rudolph Virag anuncia su cambio de nombre a Bloom."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"jerusalem","collection":"cited","name":"Jerusalem","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"6734a4d4187c2d460954c19c9f4c3caeca39dd093891649a3d5409e2cfad5965","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The traditional wish to return to Jerusalem recalls Bloom’s father and his Haggadah.","it":"Il tradizionale augurio di tornare a Gerusalemme richiama a Bloom suo padre e la sua Haggadah.","fr":"Le souhait traditionnel de revenir à Jérusalem rappelle à Bloom son père et sa Haggadah.","es":"El deseo tradicional de regresar a Jerusalén recuerda a Bloom a su padre y su Hagadá."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"monte-carlo","collection":"cited","name":"Monte Carlo","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"7b4745fa3d49b1b503a20d186245633a5a8a43db96969dd038b27cd5c5f1273d","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Monte Carlo appears in the imagined calculation of a scheme to break the bank.","it":"Monte Carlo compare nel calcolo immaginario di un sistema per sbancare il casinò.","fr":"Monte-Carlo apparaît dans le calcul imaginaire d’un système pour faire sauter la banque.","es":"Montecarlo aparece en el cálculo imaginario de un sistema para hacer saltar la banca."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"naples","collection":"cited","name":"Naples","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"1cba83ccc34bfa8d8d8038a4c8f6c4b41676cfdafcc6ec575be6fe77332553de","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The bay of Naples figures in the catalogue of distant places contemplated in Ithaca.","it":"Il golfo di Napoli compare nel catalogo di luoghi lontani contemplati in Itaca.","fr":"La baie de Naples figure dans le catalogue des lieux lointains évoqués dans Ithaque.","es":"La bahía de Nápoles figura en el catálogo de lugares lejanos contemplados en Ítaca."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"palestine","collection":"cited","name":"Palestine","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"247cde43a4c18fcc1e9c8d4600c652f64f30a11a0c98efcb5599ac157d28b3d3","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Palestine appears in the title Stephen gives to a story, alongside a reference to Mount Pisgah.","it":"La Palestina compare nel titolo che Stephen dà a un racconto, insieme a un riferimento al monte Pisgah.","fr":"La Palestine apparaît dans le titre que Stephen donne à un récit, avec une référence au mont Pisgah.","es":"Palestina aparece en el título que Stephen da a un relato, junto a una referencia al monte Pisgah."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"pacific","collection":"cited","name":"Pacific Ocean","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"c7e594cffc4350a19a73a7188207b1c6824a1b754b730209fa21734fba87ae3e","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The Pacific appears in the reflection on water and the ocean’s immense depth.","it":"Il Pacifico compare nella riflessione sull’acqua e sull’immensa profondità dell’oceano.","fr":"Le Pacifique apparaît dans la réflexion sur l’eau et l’immense profondeur de l’océan.","es":"El Pacífico aparece en la reflexión sobre el agua y la inmensa profundidad del océano."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"ronda","collection":"cited","name":"Ronda","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"244887b9cf9507bf049c70703b00599494804d1c1e30c14737dfc4d6eac4b670","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Molly recalls Ronda and its old windows among her memories of Spain.","it":"Molly ricorda Ronda e le sue vecchie finestre fra le memorie della Spagna.","fr":"Molly se rappelle Ronda et ses vieilles fenêtres parmi ses souvenirs d’Espagne.","es":"Molly recuerda Ronda y sus viejas ventanas entre sus recuerdos de España."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"russia","collection":"cited","name":"Russia","noteHash":"dae0590e001380267e5264352d7b9d92","positionSource":"d7638e693adbcb1b5943408219d38aa73a4614568150ed2a00ee7dfd219dde49","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The sailor claims to have seen Russia while recounting the places he has visited.","it":"Il marinaio sostiene di aver visto la Russia mentre racconta i luoghi visitati.","fr":"Le marin affirme avoir vu la Russie en racontant les lieux qu’il a visités.","es":"El marinero afirma haber visto Rusia al contar los lugares que ha visitado."}}}]'::jsonb; expected integer := 20;
begin
 if (select count(*) from public.place_descriptions d join jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,"noteHash" text,"positionSource" text,"narrativeSource" text,description jsonb) on d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection where md5(coalesce(d.note,''))=x."noteHash" and d.position_source_id::text=x."positionSource" and d.narrative_source_id::text is not distinct from x."narrativeSource" and (not (coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb) ? 'positionDescription') or d.metadata->'positionDescription'=x.description)) <> expected then raise exception 'A source or summary changed; no updates applied'; end if;
 update public.place_descriptions d set metadata=jsonb_set(coalesce(d.metadata,'{}'::jsonb),'{positionDescription}',x.description,true) from jsonb_to_recordset(p) x(book text,id text,collection text,description jsonb) where d.book_id=x.book and d.place_id=x.id and d.collection=x.collection;
end $revision$;
commit;
